 <office:body>
  <office:text>
<text:p text:style-name="Title">My Document Converter 샘플 문서</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Subtitle">SHKWON</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Subtitle">2026-09-22</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark text:name="소개-introduction"/>소개 (Introduction)</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">이 문서는 <text:span text:style-name="Bold">My Document Converter</text:span> 가 지원하는 모든 출력 형식의 샘플을 만드는 데 쓰이는 원본입니다. <text:span text:style-name="Italic">강조</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Bold">굵게</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Strike">취소선</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Code">인라인 코드</text:span>, H<text:span text:style-name="Sub">2</text:span>O 와 x<text:span text:style-name="Sup">2</text:span>, 그리고 <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://example.com" text:style-name="Internet_20_link">링크</text:a>를 담고 있습니다. This paragraph is in English so that Latin-only formats still show something readable.</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="목록-lists"/>목록 (Lists)</text:h>
<text:list text:style-name="Bullets"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">첫 번째 항목</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">두 번째 항목</text:p><text:list text:style-name="Bullets"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">중첩된 항목</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">또 하나의 중첩 항목</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">세 번째 항목</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
<text:list text:style-name="Numbering"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">순서가 있는 항목</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">두 번째</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">세 번째</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
<text:list text:style-name="Bullets"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">☒ 끝난 일</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">☐ 남은 일</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">용어</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Quotations">용어에 대한 정의입니다.</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">Pandoc</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Quotations">범용 문서 변환기. 이 프로그램은 같은 형식 집합을 자체 엔진으로 다룹니다.</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="코드-code"/>코드 (Code)</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">function greet(name) {</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text"> <text:s text:c="1"/>console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`)</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">}</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Preformatted_20_Text">greet('world')</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="표-table"/>표 (Table)</text:h>
<table:table table:name="Tablemvyhi"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableHeadCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="CellHead">형식</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableHeadCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="CellHead">확장자</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableHeadCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="CellHead">읽기</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableHeadCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="CellHead">쓰기</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table-header-rows><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Standard">Markdown</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">.md</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">O</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Right">O</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Standard">HTML</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">.html</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">O</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Right">O</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Standard">DOCX</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">.docx</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">O</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Right">O</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Standard">EPUB</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">.epub</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Center">O</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Right">O</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:p text:style-name="Caption">지원 형식의 일부</text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="인용과-수식-quote-and-math"/>인용과 수식 (Quote and math)</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Quotations">좋은 문서는 어떤 형식으로도 읽힙니다. — 누군가</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">인라인 수식 <text:span text:style-name="Italic">E = mc^2</text:span> 과 블록 수식:</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Italic">\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}</text:span></text:p>
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="각주와-그림-footnote-and-figure"/>각주와 그림 (Footnote and figure)</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">각주가 붙은 문장입니다.<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">각주의 내용입니다.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> 자동 링크 <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://pandoc.org" text:style-name="Internet_20_link">https://pandoc.org</text:a> 와 <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="mailto:knix008@naver.com" text:style-name="Internet_20_link">mailto:knix008@naver.com</text:a> 도 있습니다.</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Italic">[프로그램 아이콘: ../public/app-icon.svg]</text:span></text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Rule"/>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">마지막 문단입니다. 줄 끝에 두 칸을 두면<text:line-break/>강제 줄바꿈이 됩니다.</text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>
